Q2. Write 3 differences between Agile and Waterfall models.
~~> 1. Work : Waterfall me ek ke bad dusra step  follow karte he. jese planning ke bad design uske bad codding ek khatam hone ke bad hi dusra stage sharu hota he. jab Agile me chhote chote part me kam hota he har step ke bad customer se confirm karte he.
~~> 2. Changes : Waterfall me change karna bahut mushkil jab agile me customer jab bolega tabj=hi change karte he.
~~> 3.Product : Waterfall me last me project milta he. jab Agile me har step ke bad milta he.

